@startuml
!include common.puml
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
top to bottom direction
class ReviewService {
  +correct()
  +submitFieldResult()
}
interface PoiRevisionPort {
  +getRevision()
  +createRevision()
  +setReviewSummary(...)
}
class PoiRevisionAdapter {
  +createRevision()
  +setReviewSummary(...)
}
class PoiService {
  +submitNew()
  +createFieldCheckRevision()
}
class IdentityService {
  +currentUser()
  +requireRole(role)
}
ReviewService -right-> PoiRevisionPort : 调用端口
PoiRevisionPort <|.. PoiRevisionAdapter : 实现
PoiRevisionAdapter -right-> PoiService : 委托
ReviewService -down-> IdentityService : 校验身份
PoiService -left-> IdentityService : 校验角色
@enduml
